{"id": "1541603317648457818", "channel_id": "1540778699413131424", "author_id": "1473096234276229172", "author_name": "nuttyputty5612", "content": "The only objective way to determine overall investment is also too much work to be feasible: add all copies of limited awakeners used (E0 = 1 etc), their investment is the total number. It's not perfect of course, since some arc 1 awakeners are worth way less than arc 2 ones for example, and since breakpoints matter very much.\nObviously doesn't take into account SF/Skill levels/account lvl/awakener lvl/gear, but I think we can assume those track pretty closely.", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:21:12.532000+00:00", "type": 19, "thread_id": "1540778699413131424", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:43:17.266000+00:00", "mentions": ["693983290423509042"], "reply_to": "1541079493328773191", "thread_title": "DTide Meta Teams and Units", "forum_channel_id": "1304022827824844842", "thread_tags": ["1304022948000043028", "1304023032297160735"]}
