{"id": "1541607408210546718", "channel_id": "1540778699413131424", "author_id": "1473096234276229172", "author_name": "nuttyputty5612", "content": "Example from my runs last season (blue ring). I'd consider this low investment.\nA5 double clear waves, limited awakener copies used (e0 = 1):\nwave 1: 8\nwave 2: 10\nwave 3: 13\nwave 4: 28 (16 of which is the whale support borrow)\n14 limited awakeners used total (incl. the Support), avg 1.75 per wave,\n59 limited copies total, avg. 7.38 limited copies per wave.\n\nwave 5 is double clear a4, so left it out. Since it's neither 400 nor 425 it's kinda hard to categorize this.", "timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:37:27.798000+00:00", "thread_id": "1540778699413131424", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-25T00:38:30.966000+00:00", "thread_title": "DTide Meta Teams and Units", "forum_channel_id": "1304022827824844842", "thread_tags": ["1304022948000043028", "1304023032297160735"]}
